Ceramic, iconographic, epigraphic and physical-anthropological analyses are ongoing. Official reporting notes that only limited human skeletal fragments survive inside the chamber and that miniature vessels of different periods were found outside it. Interpretation of the tomb occupant, reuse history and dynastic relationships is therefore still incomplete."}

{"zh": "2022–2024年对Site 75大型Jar 1的完整发掘，在石缸内部发现密集、以肢解遗骸为主的人骨组合。不同骨骼部位给出的最小个体数（MNI）并不相同：左肱骨为14，右股骨和颅骨为19，牙齿给出最高估计37；长骨沿缸壁成束分布，较小、易碎骨骼比例偏低，支持许多个体在其他地点腐解后再被转移进入石缸的次生葬解释。部分头骨与下颌仍保持接近解剖位置，说明实际葬仪过程可能比单一模式更复杂。

8件人骨/牙齿样品获得直接放射性碳年代，整体范围约为cal AD 890–1160；邻近特征中的木炭也落在相近年代。玻璃珠、陶器、铁器和铜合金铃等随葬材料与石缸平原其他葬仪遗址具有联系。", "en": "Complete excavation of Jar 1 at Site 75 between 2022 and 2024 revealed a densely packed human skeletal assemblage dominated by disarticulated remains. MNI estimates vary by element—from 14 based on the left humerus to 19 from the right femur and skull—with dentition providing the highest estimate of 37. Bundled long bones along the jar edges and the reduced representation of smaller fragile elements support secondary deposition after decomposition elsewhere, while several closely associated skull-and-mandible sets suggest a more complex funerary sequence than a single uniform practice.

Eight human bone or tooth samples were directly radiocarbon dated, indicating use spanning approximately cal AD 890–1160. Charcoal from a nearby feature falls within a comparable range. Glass beads, pottery, iron objects and a copper-based bell link the assemblage to broader mortuary traditions of the Plain of Jars."}

{"zh": "2019年在Cova de la Font Major的Gatoneres de Cal Palletes区域识别出此前长期被忽视的史前刻画。2022年一篇关于东北伊比利亚砾岩洞穴旧石器考古的 *Antiquity* 区域综述已经初步报告Font Major约100个旧石器风格具象刻画；2026年论文则首次对完整组合进行系统发表和年代、图像学分析。研究共记录280个图像单元，其中55个为动物形象，包括马科、山羊类、鹿类、牛科和罕见的熊形象，其余包括大量非具象符号。

以动物图像数量计，Font Major被作者置于伊比利亚地中海沿岸规模最大的旧石器洞穴艺术组合之列。作为比较，东部伊比利亚的Cova Dones已记录110多个图像单元、至少19个动物形象；Font Major目前记录280个图像单元和55个动物形象，明显扩大了这一地区已知洞穴艺术的规模。", "en": "Palaeolithic engravings were first recognized in 2019 in the Gatoneres de Cal Palletes sector of Cova de la Font Major, despite decades of tourist visitation. A 2022 *Antiquity* regional review of conglomerate-cave archaeology in north-eastern Iberia had already reported roughly 100 Palaeolithic-style figurative engravings at Font Major; the 2026 paper provides the first systematic presentation, chronological assessment and full analysis of the corpus: 280 motifs, including 55 zoomorphic figures—equids, caprines, cervids, bovids and a rare bear—together with numerous non-figurative signs.

By number of zoomorphic representations, the authors place Font Major among the largest Palaeolithic parietal-art assemblages of Mediterranean Iberia. For comparison, Cova Dones in eastern Iberia has more than 110 recorded graphic units and at least 19 zoomorphs, whereas Font Major currently has 280 motifs and 55 zoomorphic figures, substantially expanding the known scale of cave art in the region."}

{"zh": "Duke、Torvinen和Wallis对58件普通与装饰陶片进行成分、岩相和技术分析，并结合放射性碳年代模型。中子活化分析显示装饰陶器与Tampa Bay本地黏土的化学组成相符，排除了“整器由北方输入”作为主要解释；但装饰陶器与普通地方陶器在制作技术上存在系统差异：前者普遍采用grog掺和、线圈成形和更一致的泥料配方，而且部分grog中含有佛罗里达半岛本地地质环境不常见的云母等成分。

装饰陶器中约80%使用grog，而普通陶器中没有一件采用这种配方。研究者进一步提出，部分装饰陶器所用grog来自有意打碎的旧装饰陶器，并可能保存“祖传”掺和材料。与北方同期密西西比地区普遍使用grog的传统相结合，尤其是约200英里以北Tallahassee Hills大型密西西比土丘中心附近的普遍做法，作者认为最能解释这些差异的是：来自佛罗里达Panhandle/北方密西西比文化圈的陶工迁入Tampa Bay，在当地形成一个掌握专门技术知识的制作社群。", "en": "Duke, Torvinen and Wallis analyzed 58 plain and decorated sherds using compositional, petrographic and technological evidence together with radiocarbon modeling. Neutron activation analysis matched the decorated vessels chemically to local Tampa Bay clays, ruling out wholesale importation as the main explanation; technologically, however, decorated vessels differ systematically from ordinary local wares: they commonly use grog temper, coiling and more standardized paste recipes, and some grog contains mica uncommon in peninsular Florida geological contexts.

Roughly 80% of decorated wares in the sample contain grog, whereas none of the plain wares do. The authors further argue that some grog derived from deliberately broken decorated vessels and may have included curated ancestral temper. Combined with widespread grog use at contemporaneous sites farther north—especially around the Tallahassee Hills, roughly 200 miles away and home to the nearest massive Mississippian mound center—the authors argue that migrant potters from the Florida Panhandle established a local community of practice in Tampa Bay."}

{"zh": "研究团队在2021–2023年重新发掘Lakhuti-IV的PC6、PC5和PC4文化层，并结合塔吉克斯坦博物馆保存的历史发掘材料，对3534件石器进行统一技术分析。研究表明三个古土壤层的石器组合高度相似，不支持过去认为从“早期旧石器”逐步演变到“中期旧石器”的简单技术进化序列。

年代学方面，研究综合三条黄土—古土壤剖面的286个释光年代、16组石英^26Al–^10Be宇生核素数据和磁性地层界线，建立概率年龄—深度模型。结果显示Karatau传统在MIS 15开始时出现，在MIS 13和MIS 11繁盛，并在MIS 10开始前后消失，持续约20–25万年。冰期黄土层中石器显著减少，提示气候波动与高原利用强度之间存在联系。", "en": "Field campaigns from 2021 to 2023 re-excavated the PC6, PC5 and PC4 horizons at Lakhuti-IV and integrated these new materials with historically excavated collections curated in Tajikistan. Technological analysis of 3,534 artifacts shows strong continuity among the three assemblages and does not support an earlier model of simple directional evolution toward Middle Palaeolithic technology.

Chronologically, the study combines 286 luminescence ages from three loess–palaeosol sections, 16 quartz ^26Al–^10Be measurements and magnetostratigraphic boundaries within probabilistic age-depth models. The Karatau tradition appears around the onset of MIS 15, flourishes during MIS 13 and 11 and disappears around the beginning of MIS 10, spanning roughly 200–250 thousand years. Sparse artifacts in intervening glacial loess suggest strong climatic modulation of occupation intensity."}

{"zh": "研究团队在2021–2023年重新发掘Lakhuti-IV的PC6、PC5和PC4文化层，并结合塔吉克斯坦博物馆保存的历史发掘材料，对3534件石器进行统一技术分析。研究表明三个古土壤层的石器组合高度相似，不支持过去认为从“早期旧石器”逐步演变到“中期旧石器”的简单技术进化序列。

年代学方面，研究综合三条黄土—古土壤剖面的286个释光年代、16组石英^26Al–^10Be宇生核素数据和磁性地层界线，建立概率年龄—深度模型。结果显示Karatau传统在MIS 15开始时出现，在MIS 13和MIS 11繁盛，并在MIS 10开始前后消失，持续约20–25万年。冰期黄土层中石器显著减少，提示气候波动与高原利用强度之间存在联系。", "en": "Field campaigns from 2021 to 2023 re-excavated the PC6, PC5 and PC4 horizons at Lakhuti-IV and integrated these new materials with historically excavated collections curated in Tajikistan. Technological analysis of 3,534 artifacts shows strong continuity among the three assemblages and does not support an earlier model of simple directional evolution toward Middle Palaeolithic technology.

Chronologically, the study combines 286 luminescence ages from three loess–palaeosol sections, 16 quartz ^26Al–^10Be measurements and magnetostratigraphic boundaries within probabilistic age-depth models. The Karatau tradition appears around the onset of MIS 15, flourishes during MIS 13 and 11 and disappears around the beginning of MIS 10, spanning roughly 200–250 thousand years. Sparse artifacts in intervening glacial loess suggest strong climatic modulation of occupation intensity."}

{"zh": "2022年发掘共获得5000多件文化遗物，其中4708件为石器，另有654件赭石/赤铁矿。新探方穿过1985年停止的深度，进入新的CU2a层，并确认石器继续向下延伸。年龄模型把CU2a起始放在约64–55 ka，但作者注意到底部器物密度很低，因此没有把层位起始年代直接当作“首次占据”年代，而是采用CU2a–CU2b过渡附近较高密度器物的加权OSL年代，保守推定最早人类活动为≥55±4 ka。

约55–37 ka层段中出现大量赭石、磨石和石器活动，提示遗址不仅是短暂停留点，还可能承担食物加工、颜料处理和社会/仪式活动。整个序列跨越末次冰期到全新世，记录技术、原料和居住强度的长期变化。", "en": "The 2022 excavation recovered more than 5,000 cultural objects, including 4,708 stone artifacts and 654 ochre/haematite pieces. Excavation extended below the 1985 limit into a newly defined CU2a, confirming deeper artifacts. Although the modeled onset of CU2a lies between about 64 and 55 ka, artifact densities are very low at its base. The authors therefore use the higher-density concentration near the CU2a–CU2b transition and conservatively infer initial activity at ≥55 ± 4 ka.

Between roughly 55 and 37 ka, abundant haematite, grinding stones and lithic activity suggest repeated use for food processing, pigment preparation and possibly social or ceremonial practices. The sequence continues through the last glacial period and into the Holocene, documenting long-term shifts in technology, raw materials and occupation intensity."}

{"zh": "2022年发掘共获得5000多件文化遗物，其中4708件为石器，另有654件赭石/赤铁矿。新探方穿过1985年停止的深度，进入新的CU2a层，并确认石器继续向下延伸。年龄模型把CU2a起始放在约64–55 ka，但作者注意到底部器物密度很低，因此没有把层位起始年代直接当作“首次占据”年代，而是采用CU2a–CU2b过渡附近较高密度器物的加权OSL年代，保守推定最早人类活动为≥55±4 ka。

约55–37 ka层段中出现大量赭石、磨石和石器活动，提示遗址不仅是短暂停留点，还可能承担食物加工、颜料处理和社会/仪式活动。整个序列跨越末次冰期到全新世，记录技术、原料和居住强度的长期变化。", "en": "The 2022 excavation recovered more than 5,000 cultural objects, including 4,708 stone artifacts and 654 ochre/haematite pieces. Excavation extended below the 1985 limit into a newly defined CU2a, confirming deeper artifacts. Although the modeled onset of CU2a lies between about 64 and 55 ka, artifact densities are very low at its base. The authors therefore use the higher-density concentration near the CU2a–CU2b transition and conservatively infer initial activity at ≥55 ± 4 ka.

Between roughly 55 and 37 ka, abundant haematite, grinding stones and lithic activity suggest repeated use for food processing, pigment preparation and possibly social or ceremonial practices. The sequence continues through the last glacial period and into the Holocene, documenting long-term shifts in technology, raw materials and occupation intensity."}

{"zh": "Bongal材料包括带凸耳船板、木钉、仍可识别的棕榈纤维绑缚、大型quarter rudder，以及一块带Pallava–Grantha文字的木板。技术分析显示这些构件符合东南亚lashed-lug造船传统。伴出的陶器、玻璃、珠饰和钱币等材料进一步表明Bongal参与了公元7–8世纪印度洋海上交换。

作者认定一件长4.38米的quarter rudder（放射性碳校正年代公元656–687年）是目前东南亚**最早可靠测年的舵**，并指出Bongal把lashed-lug传统明确扩展到苏门答腊西海岸。这里的“最早”是作者基于现有已测年材料提出的比较判断。", "en": "The Bongal assemblage includes hull planks with carved lugs, wooden dowels, preserved palm-fibre lashings, a large quarter rudder and an inscribed plank in Pallava–Grantha script. Technological analysis places the timbers within the Southeast Asian lashed-lug tradition. Associated ceramics, glass, beads and coins further indicate participation in seventh- to eighth-century Indian Ocean maritime exchange.

The authors identify a 4.38-m quarter rudder, radiocarbon dated to AD 656–687, as the earliest securely dated rudder currently known in Southeast Asia and regard Bongal as a firm archaeological extension of the lashed-lug tradition to Sumatra’s west coast."}

{"zh": "Bongal材料包括带凸耳船板、木钉、仍可识别的棕榈纤维绑缚、大型quarter rudder，以及一块带Pallava–Grantha文字的木板。技术分析显示这些构件符合东南亚lashed-lug造船传统。伴出的陶器、玻璃、珠饰和钱币等材料进一步表明Bongal参与了公元7–8世纪印度洋海上交换。

作者认定一件长4.38米的quarter rudder（放射性碳校正年代公元656–687年）是目前东南亚**最早可靠测年的舵**，并指出Bongal把lashed-lug传统明确扩展到苏门答腊西海岸。这里的“最早”是作者基于现有已测年材料提出的比较判断。", "en": "The Bongal assemblage includes hull planks with carved lugs, wooden dowels, preserved palm-fibre lashings, a large quarter rudder and an inscribed plank in Pallava–Grantha script. Technological analysis places the timbers within the Southeast Asian lashed-lug tradition. Associated ceramics, glass, beads and coins further indicate participation in seventh- to eighth-century Indian Ocean maritime exchange.

The authors identify a 4.38-m quarter rudder, radiocarbon dated to AD 656–687, as the earliest securely dated rudder currently known in Southeast Asia and regard Bongal as a firm archaeological extension of the lashed-lug tradition to Sumatra’s west coast."}
